-- Fill the columns 0018 added, for the rows already stored, from what the sources said.
--
-- Generated on 14 September 2026 from the register records and portfolio pages cached by
-- the last runs (ingest/cache), matched to live rows by id. The nightly run writes the
-- same values from then on (ingest/sources/*.py, ingest/run.py).
--
-- The register: 199 rows carry a DPIIT evidence line. 191 match a cached record — 130
-- recognised, 58 with no recognition at all, 3 expired. Each line now says what its record
-- says. The 8 with no cached record get a line that claims nothing either way, until a run
-- reads them again.
--
-- A company that was called one only because "DPIIT recognises only incorporated
-- companies" is judged again with its real status (ingest/entity.py).
--
-- Founders: the names SINE IIT Bombay, Venture Center and IITM RTBI print on each card.

